":"gigara"},"message":"docs(macos): drop the last references to a .pkg that is no longer built\n\nThree comments still described the package: the editor-update profile line in\nbuild.yml, and two in build.sh — the hdiutil-detach backoff note and the\nSquirrel payload explanation. My grep for pkgbuild/productbuild/.pkg missed\nDMG/PKG and a bare ''the pkg'', which is how they survived.\n\nThe surviving mention at build.yml:678 is deliberate: it says why no Developer\nID Installer certificate is imported.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"555a663e59c8291d06b4f6c71442c254a9f4de0a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/555a663e59c8291d06b4f6c71442c254a9f4de0a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/8613aecad350e4a4203c2b253025c1e9928233c2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16335290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/8613aecad350e4a4203c2b253025c1e9928233c2","node_id":"C_kwDO