_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/372b4cc17d4eda3e72a038aade0933185ba4f489","node_id":"C_kwDOPy5-RNoAKDM3MmI0Y2MxN2Q0ZWRhM2U3MmEwMzhhYWRlMDkzMzE4NWJhNGY0ODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/7673eddc10d65d2585b6ee764eae8caa6ca3d4b8","sha":"7673eddc10d65d2585b6ee764eae8caa6ca3d4b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/7673eddc10d65d2585b6ee764eae8caa6ca3d4b8"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291","sha":"014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291"}],"sha":"372b4cc17d4eda3e72a038aade0933185ba4f489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/372b4cc17d4eda3e72a038aade0933185ba4f489"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16335290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T07:57:48Z","email":"info@gigara.info","name":"gigara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:13:25Z","email":"nipunaranasinghe93@gmail.com","name":"NipunaRanasinghe"},"message":"fix(ci): scope the update-bucket credentials to the upload, and fail on a half-configured release\n\nconfigure-aws-credentials writes AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID, AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY and\nthe region into $GITHUB_ENV, so they stay in scope for every later step in the\njob — six of them here, including cosign-installer, which fetches a third-party\nbinary. This is the only AWS consumer in the job, so its own `env:` block does\nthe job and actually scopes them to the one step.\n\nThe step also failed open. Gated on secret presence, a run with\npublish_update_source but no bucket or credentials skipped it silently while\npublish-update-source still embedded app.squirrel.url in the darwin manifest —\na 404 for every macOS client at apply time, out of a green build. That is the\nfailure this branch set out to fix, reached by a different misconfiguration.\nIt now checks the three secrets itself and fails.\n\nWith the gate moved into the step, HAS_AWS and HAS_UPDATE_BUCKET have no\nreaders left, so the macOS job''s env block goes the way of the Windows one.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit a744490496f0d95b55eadf1f5fbbdc9f80e2354e)","tree":{"sha":"2a5336901989bdc2292e40b46ee7a299bcd52f09","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/2a5336901989bdc2292e40b46ee7a299bcd52f09"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29032600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NipunaRanasinghe","id":29032600,"login":"NipunaRanasinghe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDMyNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291","node_id":"C_kwDOPy5-RNoAKDAxNDMxMGNlMGJkYTVmMjQ3Njg1NjJjNjRiNzI2NmIzZWFmZTMyOTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d","sha":"07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d"}],"sha":"014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/014310ce0bda5f24768562c64b7266b3eafe3291"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16335290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:21:02Z","email":"info@gigara.info","name":"gigara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:13:25Z","email":"nipunaranasinghe93@gmail.com","name":"NipunaRanasinghe"},"message":"fix(ci): drop the retired installer bucket and restore the update-bucket login\n\nAWS_S3_BUCKET was the old installer bucket. Upstream removed the uploads that\nwrote to it (f7917ab), leaving HAS_INSTALLER_BUCKET computed in two job env\nblocks and read by nothing. Installers now ship as GitHub release assets and\nthe only S3 writes go to AWS_UPDATE_S3_BUCKET, so the secret is dead config.\n\nThat same commit also removed both `Login to AWS` steps, and the merge of the\nupdate mechanism restored only the one in Publish Update Source. The macOS\nSquirrel.Mac payload upload was therefore running `aws s3 cp` with no\ncredentials configured: on a publishing release it would fail the macOS build,\nand the darwin manifest''s app.squirrel.url would point at an object that was\nnever written. Configure the credentials immediately before that upload.\n\nAlso gate both steps on publish_update_source and on the update bucket being\nconfigured, replacing the in-script bucket check. Nothing writes to the update\nbucket now unless the run is a release that publishes updates.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 8b686dadee4fa1c22301641da443a5b80a60c8d2)","tree":{"sha":"4f0f35e805bb78aceaa6d5261249b3725cb35bdb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/4f0f35e805bb78aceaa6d5261249b3725cb35bdb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29032600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NipunaRanasinghe","id":29032600,"login":"NipunaRanasinghe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDMyNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/07b42d866f08a35c072d4bf6afe0e0db00837b1d","node_id":"C_kwDOPy5-RNoAKDA3YjQyZDg2NmYwOGEzNWMwNzJkNGJmNmFmZTBlMGRiMDA4MzdiMWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/