https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/fc53e4ac5a11a9dbf61e89e27609511fb1e9dc2f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:51:06Z","email":"info@gigara.info","name":"gigara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:02:00Z","email":"nipunaranasinghe93@gmail.com","name":"NipunaRanasinghe"},"message":"fix(ci): don''t fail the preflight on runs that would not publish\n\nThe gate fired on publish_update_source alone, so a release with\nbuild_packed_installers off — or with no publish_tag — failed for missing\npublish secrets even though Publish Update Source skips itself in exactly those\ncases. Mirror that job''s own conditions.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 6c93a4cb9eb117cd38de44fb0c08e143dd1da8e5)","tree":{"sha":"0f0b45f8fc155ef90f3557ddf4664ffbdb919cde","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/0f0b45f8fc155ef90f3557ddf4664ffbdb919cde"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/fc53e4ac5a11a9dbf61e89e27609511fb1e9dc2f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29032600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NipunaRanasinghe","id":29032600,"login":"NipunaRanasinghe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDMyNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/fc53e4ac5a11a9dbf61e89e27609511fb1e9dc2f","node_id":"C_kwDOPy5-RNoAKGZjNTNlNGFjNWExMWE5ZGJmNjFlODllMjc2MDk1MTFmYjFlOWRjMmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f","sha":"e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f"}],"sha":"fc53e4ac5a11a9dbf61e89e27609511fb1e9dc2f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/fc53e4ac5a11a9dbf61e89e27609511fb1e9dc2f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16335290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:47:26Z","email":"info@gigara.info","name":"gigara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:02:00Z","email":"nipunaranasinghe93@gmail.com","name":"NipunaRanasinghe"},"message":"fix(ci): require the pinned client key on any run that publishes updates\n\nWSO2_UPDATE_PUBLIC_KEY was optional, and its absence was silent in the worst\ndirection: HAS_PINNED_KEY went false, the key comparison was skipped, and\nWSO2_UPDATE_REQUIRE_ARTIFACT_SIGNATURE computed to false — so a green release\nshipped clients that pin no key and accept unverified artifacts, then published\na source document for them.\n\nCheck it in resolve-versions rather than in Publish Update Source. build-macos\nand build-windows bake WSO2_UPDATE_URL and WSO2_UPDATE_PUBLIC_KEY into\nproduct.json well before that job runs, so a late check cannot stop a run from\nproducing those installers — it can only decline to publish afterwards. The\nearly gate costs seconds instead of a full build, and covers the bucket, the\nartifacts CDN base, the update URL and the signing key alongside it.\n\nWith presence guaranteed, the pinned-key DER comparison is unconditional in\nboth workflows, and publish-components.yml requires the same secret in its own\npreflight.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit 68e50fb7eebdc0960ed23df8d2d54e556ac535d4)","tree":{"sha":"4c42241a0663a5fdab0a9caff55b8a05c7d37ad5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/4c42241a0663a5fdab0a9caff55b8a05c7d37ad5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29032600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NipunaRanasinghe","id":29032600,"login":"NipunaRanasinghe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDMyNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f","node_id":"C_kwDOPy5-RNoAKGU3MDBkZWE4NDIzMmMzMTEyN2E4OTU4OTBjN2Q5MGIzY2RhNTQ5N2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/wso2/product-integrator/commit/d880ced0e7326c61ade42ba37d21dee239e1463d","sha":"d880ced0e7326c61ade42ba37d21dee239e1463d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/d880ced0e7326c61ade42ba37d21dee239e1463d"}],"sha":"e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/e700dea84232c31127a895890c7d90b3cda5497f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16335290?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/gigara","id":16335290,"login":"gigara","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MzM1Mjkw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/gigara","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/commits/d880ced0e7326c61ade42ba37d21dee239e1463d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T05:03:30Z","email":"info@gigara.info","name":"gigara"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T18:02:00Z","email":"nipunaranasinghe93@gmail.com","name":"NipunaRanasinghe"},"message":"fix(ci): derive the signing public key instead of configuring it twice\n\nCOSIGN_PUBLIC_KEY and WSO2_UPDATE_PUBLIC_KEY held the same public key in two\nencodings -- raw PEM for cosign''s verify steps, base64 of that PEM for the string\nbaked into product.json. Two hand-set secrets for one value, and the consistency\ncheck compared them to each other.\n\nThat check could not see the mismatch that matters. Both public secrets can agree\nperfectly and still belong to a different keypair than COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY, which is\nwhat actually signs; the in-run verify steps would pass too, because they verified\nagainst the same public secret. The failure would surface on users'' machines after\nrelease, as every client rejecting every artifact.\n\nThe public half is now derived from the signing key with\n\n  cosign public-key --key env://COSIGN_PRIVATE_KEY\n\nso the comparison is pinned-key vs the key that signs, and the verify steps check\nsignatures against a key that provably belongs to the signing pair. Verified with\ntwo throwaway keypairs: correct config passes, a pinned key from the other pair is\nrefused (the case the old check missed), and a non-base64 pinned value is refused.\n\nCOSIGN_PUBLIC_KEY is no longer referenced anywhere and can be deleted from the\nrepository secrets -- one fewer value to set and to keep in sync.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n(cherry picked from commit e3e67f5eb24e87ecadd6e2a7a024b0bcd53e6491)","tree":{"sha":"a4ac1fbefca4e4d5ec28a9ad7db7d8e856ff8fd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/trees/a4ac1fbefca4e4d5ec28a9ad7db7d8e856ff8fd3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/wso2/product-integrator/git/commits/d880ced0e7326c61ade42ba37d21dee239e1463d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29032600?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/NipunaRanasinghe","id":29032600,"login":"NipunaRanasinghe","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5MDMyNjAw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/NipunaRanasinghe/repos","site_admin":false,"