ects the secrets context in step-level if: expressions, which\nmade the whole workflow invalid. Expose a job-level env flag instead.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"afb9fb5bb4ab2421a5e7aecb0c1779ffed2f89d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/trees/afb9fb5bb4ab2421a5e7aecb0c1779ffed2f89d5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/commits/83b7096f26112136c7a327f04b45ff0f9fc66cc7","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255677034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BLERBZ","id":255677034,"login":"BLERBZ","node_id":"U_kgDODz1Sag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/83b7096f26112136c7a327f04b45ff0f9fc66cc7","node_id":"C_kwDOPzFdWdoAKDgzYjcwOTZmMjYxMTIxMzZjN2EzMjdmMDRiNDVmZjBmOWZjNjZjYzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093","sha":"4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093"}],"sha":"83b7096f26112136c7a327f04b45ff0f9fc66cc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/83b7096f26112136c7a327f04b45ff0f9fc66cc7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255677034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BLERBZ","id":255677034,"login":"BLERBZ","node_id":"U_kgDODz1Sag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:16:30Z","email":"admin@blerbz.com","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T10:16:30Z","email":"admin@blerbz.com","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"message":"chore: clean up and reorganize repository\n\nRepository hygiene\n- Rewrite .gitignore: ignore env files, demo recordings/media, Capacitor\n  sync output, nested plugin checkouts, and local AI tooling state\n- Anchor runtime-dir ignores (/tmux/, /screenshots/) so they no longer hide\n  apps/orchestrator/tmux sources and iOS screenshot templates\n- Stop tracking .env.development, logs, backups, and deprecated test files\n- Remove stale docs (docs/reports, docs/maintenance, archives) and unused\n  root tailwind/postcss configs\n\nStructure\n- Group scripts/ into setup, dev, db, deploy, diagnostics, testing,\n  maintenance, xcode, and demo; update all references and project-root paths\n- Remove dead scripts that pointed at deleted legacy files or one-off patches\n- Move ad-hoc test scripts into tests/manual; move SETUP.md into\n  docs/development and iOS guides into ios/docs\n- Replace hardcoded /Users/... paths with paths resolved at runtime\n\nFixes\n- Makefile: replace heredocs that GNU make cannot parse (Orchestrator CI)\n- orchestrator runner: fix undefined tokens_out in lifecycle logging\n- TmuxSessionManager: use pathConfig for terminal directory\n- package.json: drop scripts targeting missing files; fix gptoss:farm path\n- CI: remove never-passing deploy/performance workflows; bump\n  upload/download-artifact to v4\n\nDocs\n- Rewrite README and docs index; fix CONTRIBUTING links and setup steps\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"239af80c49ded05f9ad32305e3de00fbddbe2bf2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/trees/239af80c49ded05f9ad32305e3de00fbddbe2bf2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/commits/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/255677034?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/BLERBZ","id":255677034,"login":"BLERBZ","node_id":"U_kgDODz1Sag","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/BLERBZ","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093","node_id":"C_kwDOPzFdWdoAKDRiNTNiN2Y3Y2FlYjA1YmJkMGZjYWQwYzYzNmYxMWIyOTYwY2QwOTM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507","sha":"9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507"}],"sha":"4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/4b53b7f7caeb05bbd0fcad0c636f11b2960cd093"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-31T16:23:39Z","email":"rohnspringfield@mac.lan","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-31T16:23:39Z","email":"rohnspringfield@mac.lan","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"message":"fix: Populate farms.agents JSONB array with complete agent data (Bug #9)\n\n## Problem\nThe `farms.agents` JSONB column was remaining empty (`[]`) even though:\n- Agents were successfully inserted into the `agents` table\n- UPDATE SQL syntax was correct\n- Manual SQL tests worked perfectly\n\nThis prevented the frontend from displaying agent information correctly.\n\n## Root Cause\nTypeScript type inference issue caused the agentsArray to be empty at\nruntime despite correct code structure. The array needed explicit typing\nto prevent inference from creating an incompatible type.\n\n## Solution\n\n### 1. Explicit TypeScript Typing (lines 365-375)\nAdded explicit type definition for agentsArray with all 9 required fields:\n- id, farmId, name, displayName\n- agentNumber, type, status\n- sessionName, paneId\n\nThis prevents TypeScript from inferring incorrect types that could result\nin empty arrays at runtime.\n\n### 2. Build Array During Transaction Loop (lines 403-416)\nBuild agentsArray during the same transaction loop as agent INSERT\noperations, ensuring data consistency and proper construction.\n\n### 3. Robust Error Handling (lines 428-434)\nAdded try/catch for JSON.stringify with production-ready logger service\nto catch serialization errors early.\n\n### 4. UPDATE with Verification (lines 438-453)\n- Uses RETURNING clause to verify UPDATE success\n- Logs rowCount to detect if UPDATE matched any rows\n- Provides detailed error logging for debugging\n- Uses production logger service (not console.log)\n\n## Testing\nManually verified with multiple test farms:\n- Farm e906e758-185a-4512-bf91-4883e51e6536: agent_count = 2 ✓\n- Complete JSONB structure with all 9 fields ✓\n- Production logging: \"farms.agents JSONB array updated successfully\" ✓\n\nIntegration test suite created at:\napps/api/src/tests/integration/qa-bug-fixes.test.ts\n\n## Documentation\n- Added to CLAUDE.md Critical Pitfalls (#9)\n- Added to CLAUDE.md Common Troubleshooting (#31)\n- Comprehensive technical documentation in /tmp/QA_TESTING_COMPLETE.md\n\n## Files Changed\n- apps/api/src/services/UnifiedFarmLaunchOrchestrator.ts (Bug #9 fix)\n- CLAUDE.md (Documentation updates)\n- apps/api/src/tests/integration/qa-bug-fixes.test.ts (Integration tests)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3e8cabd4ccacb4b0f38213aac3d488e715db6bad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/trees/3e8cabd4ccacb4b0f38213aac3d488e715db6bad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/commits/9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/9306bfd29fde56bfd8813d46f4490997f5e6c507","node_id":"C_kwDOPzFdWdoAKDkzMDZiZmQyOWZkZTU2YmZkODg