or external APIs\n- Define TypeScript interfaces for all services\n- Install required dependencies: sentiment, compromise, pdfkit, sharp, svgo, bottleneck, jsdom\n\nThese services provide the foundation for the core agents to perform data collection,\ncontent analysis, visualization generation, and output assembly phases.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7be1258bb9b4edb2052a5b117855cd43ed1b0175","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/trees/7be1258bb9b4edb2052a5b117855cd43ed1b0175"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/commits/5534982570ae1dd7b120b65c156b28de02bdff35","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/5534982570ae1dd7b120b65c156b28de02bdff35","node_id":"C_kwDOPzFdWdoAKDU1MzQ5ODI1NzBhZTFkZDdiMTIwYjY1YzE1NmIyOGRlMDJiZGZmMzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749","sha":"901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749"}],"sha":"5534982570ae1dd7b120b65c156b28de02bdff35","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/5534982570ae1dd7b120b65c156b28de02bdff35"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-05T14:53:35Z","email":"rohnspringfield@mac.lan","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-05T14:53:35Z","email":"rohnspringfield@mac.lan","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"message":"feat: Implement Phase 1 of MaiFarm Multi-Agent Improvements\n\n- Add Agent Health Monitoring System:\n  - Heartbeat-based health monitoring with adaptive timeouts\n  - Real-time agent status tracking (working/idle/error/disabled)\n  - Context percentage monitoring with auto-clear triggers\n  - Cycle time tracking and performance metrics\n  - Event-based notifications for health changes\n\n- Add File-Based Work Coordination:\n  - Distributed locking system to prevent agent conflicts\n  - Work claim management with dependency tracking\n  - Automatic conflict detection and resolution\n  - Stale lock and claim cleanup mechanisms\n  - Work queue system for planned tasks\n\nThis implementation provides the foundation for robust multi-agent coordination,\npreventing conflicts and ensuring reliable agent health monitoring.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4fe0d8c3f39a47b031d9480a283e79345062fa45","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/trees/4fe0d8c3f39a47b031d9480a283e79345062fa45"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/git/commits/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749","node_id":"C_kwDOPzFdWdoAKDkwMTI2MmNlZjU1YTc0N2U5ZjE0MmEyNGVjZTIxMDFiMmFkYTY3NDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/MoRohn/maifarm/commit/b4e4e1c3aa8dbaa997e1dacdf352d2120cd7d1c5","sha":"b4e4e1c3aa8dbaa997e1dacdf352d2120cd7d1c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/b4e4e1c3aa8dbaa997e1dacdf352d2120cd7d1c5"}],"sha":"901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/901262cef55a747e9f142a24ece2101b2ada6749"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/MoRohn/maifarm/commits/b4e4e1c3aa8dbaa997e1dacdf352d2120cd7d1c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-30T21:31:40Z","email":"rohnspringfield@mac.lan","name":"Rohn Springfield"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-30T21:31: