deps which removes node_modules\n       AFTER npm ci but BEFORE vite build\n\nSolution: Removed prevercel-build script from package.json\n\nBuild sequence now:\n1. npm ci (installs packages)\n2. vercel-build → build:fast → vite build (✅ works)\n\nPrevious broken sequence:\n1. npm ci (installs packages)\n2. prevercel-build → clean:deps (❌ deletes node_modules)\n3. vercel-build → vite build (❌ command not found)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2811daf6102ea74b7ef5f7e2a4000249b7142f1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/2811daf6102ea74b7ef5f7e2a4000249b7142f1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/a22821e66ea69ebaafe1ebabf7b904b3a4573f33","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/a22821e66ea69ebaafe1ebabf7b904b3a4573f33","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKGEyMjgyMWU2NmVhNjllYmFhZmUxZWJhYmY3YjkwNGIzYTQ1NzNmMzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5","sha":"6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5"}],"sha":"a22821e66ea69ebaafe1ebabf7b904b3a4573f33","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/a22821e66ea69ebaafe1ebabf7b904b3a4573f33"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-13T02:31:29Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-13T02:31:29Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"message":"fix: Solution 5 - remove PDF chunk conflict causing circular dependency\n\nIssue: ReferenceError \"Cannot access ''Nj'' before initialization\"\nRoot Cause: Conflito entre optimizeDeps.exclude e manualChunks\n- optimizeDeps excluía PDF/compression libs (Solution 4)\n- manualChunks ainda tentava agrupar mesmas libs em ''vendor-pdf''\n- Conflito causava circular dependency e heap overflow\n\nSolution 5:\n- Reverteu optimizeDeps.exclude para apenas @playwright/test\n- Comentou criação do chunk ''vendor-pdf'' no manualChunks\n- Deixa Vite/Rollup decidir naturalmente como bundlar PDF libs\n- Mantém lazy loading via lib/heavyLibrariesLazy.ts\n\nFiles Changed:\n- vite.config.ts: Lines 201-208 (optimizeDeps.exclude)\n- vite.config.ts: Lines 376-382 (manualChunks vendor-pdf)\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9ac84f9e7ebf48e776525b628d41d9e60548d0ad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/9ac84f9e7ebf48e776525b628d41d9e60548d0ad"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKDZkMzM1YzIxMTEwZGViZDM4ZTg0NjU0ZWQ4NTU3YTBiZTc2MDFkYjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/c5d37ea0d3929ddbc920710973b868294931e45e","sha":"c5d37ea0d3929ddbc920710973b868294931e45e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/c5d37ea0d3929ddbc920710973b868294931e45e"}],"sha":"6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/6d335c21110debd38e84654ed8557a0be7601db5"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dud