ibs (pako, fflate, brotli)\n- Bundle inicial de 1.37MB com PDF libraries\n\nSOLUÇÃO 4 - LAZY LOAD COMPLETO:\n\n1. optimizeDeps.exclude - Excluir libs do bundle inicial:\n   - PDF: jspdf, jspdf-autotable, @react-pdf/renderer, pdfjs-dist, html2canvas\n   - Compression: pako, fflate, brotli, zlib\n\n2. Desativar manual chunking para PDF/compression libs:\n   - Comentado feature-pdf chunk\n   - Comentado vendor-pdf chunk\n   - Libs carregadas APENAS via dynamic import()\n\n3. Lazy loading infrastructure já existe:\n   - lib/heavyLibrariesLazy.ts\n   - lib/pdf/pdfGeneratorLazy.ts\n   - Sem imports diretos no codebase\n\nBENEFÍCIOS ESPERADOS:\n- ✅ Eliminar circular dependency (libs não estarão no bundle)\n- ✅ Reduzir bundle inicial em ~1.37MB\n- ✅ Carregar PDF libs apenas quando necessário\n- ✅ Resolver erro de \"Carregando...\" infinito\n\n🤖 Generated with Claude Code\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f8d1104133b81ebecc13f88233fc9e2f8cfb43a9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/f8d1104133b81ebecc13f88233fc9e2f8cfb43a9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/f3262edcc758a296fc7405a6ad29be1be2b53c1c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/f3262edcc758a296fc7405a6ad29be1be2b53c1c","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKGYzMjYyZWRjYzc1OGEyOTZmYzc0MDVhNmFkMjliZTFiZTJiNTNjMWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/53e33fbc3b88af0826a1cb302460c324f4d636b6","sha":"53e33fbc3b88af0826a1cb302460c324f4d636b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/53e33fbc3b88af0826a1cb302460c324f4d636b6"}],"sha":"f3262edcc758a296fc7405a6ad29be1be2b53c1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/f3262edcc758a296fc7405a6ad29be1be2b53c1c"},{"author":null,"com