ed session\n- Add VERCEL_DEPLOYMENT_GUIDE.md for deployment workflow\n- Document dark mode implementation and typography guide\n\n## Technical Improvements\n- Convert useAppointments.js to TypeScript\n- Optimize vite.config.ts with granular code splitting\n- Better cache invalidation with smaller chunks\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"50ef31edfa7ccb15ac011cf3d3680a211b540f80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/50ef31edfa7ccb15ac011cf3d3680a211b540f80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/252f9838e43136271cdf233235fc843db47ea67a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/252f9838e43136271cdf233235fc843db47ea67a","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKDI1MmY5ODM4ZTQzMTM2MjcxY2RmMjMzMjM1ZmM4NDNkYjQ3ZWE2N2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/1ecda2f58b0a22c5daff496913f7cc01a4538726","sha":"1ecda2f58b0a22c5daff496913f7cc01a4538726","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/1ecda2f58b0a22c5daff496913f7cc01a4538726"}],"sha":"252f9838e43136271cdf233235fc843db47ea67a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/252f9838e43136271cdf233235fc843db47ea67a"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/1ecda2f58b0a22c5daff496913f7cc01a4538726/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-12T02:45:51Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-12T02:45:51Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"message":"chore: otimizar pipeline vercel","tree":{"sha":"2ef1b52318c4799b8f30034da55627955d5335f2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelmin