o em 1 clique\n\n📦 Arquivos:\n- 7 componentes React criados\n- 3 services criados\n- 5 tipos TypeScript definidos\n- 2 migrations SQL criadas e aplicadas\n- 1 bucket storage configurado\n\n🗄️ Database:\n- Tabela evolution_templates criada\n- 5 colunas adicionadas em session_evolutions\n- Bucket progress-photos configurado\n- Políticas RLS aplicadas (4)\n\n✅ Qualidade:\n- Build: SUCESSO (8.45MB)\n- TypeScript: SEM ERROS\n- Linter: SEM ERROS\n- Dependência: @react-pdf/renderer instalada\n\n📚 Documentação: 12 guias criados\n\nStatus: ✅ Testado e validado localmente\nPronto para produção!","tree":{"sha":"83bd85af4a25eea4a2f0636a29715441f02c7161","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/83bd85af4a25eea4a2f0636a29715441f02c7161"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/970dcf7f0236f878064d8fbe29c9005a2a7d0104","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/970dcf7f0236f878064d8fbe29c9005a2a7d0104","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKDk3MGRjZjdmMDIzNmY4NzgwNjRkOGZiZTI5YzkwMDVhMmE3ZDAxMDQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/3767b57cb1e136b12dff6a3cce23819fe5686e2e","sha":"3767b57cb1e136b12dff6a3cce23819fe5686e2e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/3767b57cb1e136b12dff6a3cce23819fe5686e2e"}],"sha":"970dcf7f0236f878064d8fbe29c9005a2a7d0104","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/970dcf7f0236f878064d8fbe29c9005a2a7d0104"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/3767b57cb1e136b12dff6a3cce23819fe5686e2e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-05T15:33:03Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-05T15:33:03Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com",