ations aplicam com sucesso\n- Schema consistente e sem conflitos\n- db diff retorna ''No schema changes found'' ✅","tree":{"sha":"63ee42446eb508e6e22bb5224515076eed4aa474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/63ee42446eb508e6e22bb5224515076eed4aa474"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/214dcb0251abae3e95478b61a02154fb11923189","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/214dcb0251abae3e95478b61a02154fb11923189","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKDIxNGRjYjAyNTFhYmFlM2U5NTQ3OGI2MWEwMjE1NGZiMTE5MjMxODk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735","sha":"84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735"}],"sha":"214dcb0251abae3e95478b61a02154fb11923189","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/214dcb0251abae3e95478b61a02154fb11923189"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-01T03:19:41Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-01T03:19:41Z","email":"rafaelminatto1@gmail.com","name":"Rafael Minatto"},"message":"feat: adicionar novos componentes e modernização do sistema\n\nNovos componentes e funcionalidades:\n- Componentes de acessibilidade\n- Componentes de appointments\n- Novos gráficos (Cohort, Comparative, Distribution, Funnel, Heatmap, Trend)\n- Componentes comuns modernizados (ActionMenu, DataTable, FilterPanel, SearchBar, etc)\n- Componentes de dashboard (Filters, Grid, WidgetWrapper, widgets)\n- Componentes de exercícios (Card, Filters)\n- Componentes mobile e navigation\n- Componentes de pacientes (BulkActions, Card, Filters, QuickActions)\n- Novos componentes UI (combobox, date-range-picker, multi-select, skeleton-table)\n\nNovos hooks:\n- useBulkActions\n- useCRUD\n- useDashboardLayout\n- useExportData\n- useFormPersist\n- useLazyLoad\n- useSwipeGestures\n- useTableFilters\n- useTablePagination\n\nNovas páginas:\n- AppointmentListPage\n- DashboardPageV2\n- ExerciseListPage\n- PatientListPageV2\n- ProtocolListPage\n\nNovos serviços CRUD:\n- appointmentCRUDService\n- dashboardLayoutService\n- exerciseCRUDService\n- patientCRUDService\n- protocolCRUDService\n\nMelhorias e correções:\n- AppRoutes otimizado\n- OptimizedAppointmentCard melhorado\n- ConfirmDialog atualizado\n- ResponsiveSidebar modernizado\n- PatientTable corrigido\n- ProtocolCard atualizado\n- mockData expandido\n- useAppointments otimizado\n- useMediaQuery melhorado\n- registerSW atualizado\n- MainDashboard modernizado\n- acompanhamentoService melhorado\n\nDocumentação:\n- Relatório de deploy Vercel\n- Guias de modernização\n- Exemplos de código\n- Índice de documentação\n- Guia de uso de componentes","tree":{"sha":"aea9111081cf60d52dc155f28b4daa6edc92c94a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/trees/aea9111081cf60d52dc155f28b4daa6edc92c94a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/git/commits/84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/84f19d73695a238176eebacb1d73d89f6d225735","node_id":"C_kwDOPzIiP9oAKDg0ZjE5ZDczNjk1YTIzODE3NmVlYmFjYjFkNzNkODlmNmQyMjU3MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commit/16f36fadf5ed6cebcedbcb8fd1a7b0785082e521","sha":"16f36fadf5ed6cebcedbcb8fd1a7b0785082e521","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rafaelminatto1/dudufisio-AI/commits/1