_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/hi-neason","id":69571456,"login":"hi-neason","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY5NTcxNDU2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/b551036042d508e74075f1356e7a8726b64305d6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:02:57Z","email":"69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hi-neason"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:02:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ai-service): stop logging upstream API key and chat payloads (#873)\n\nchat_completions logged the full Authorization header (Bearer upstream LLM API key) at INFO, plus the full request params/model_dump containing user message content. Drop those log lines; the credential and message bodies must not reach logs. Non-sensitive request-flow logs are kept.\n\nAdd an infra-free regression test asserting the key is still sent upstream but neither it nor the message body appears in logs.\n\nSigned-off-by: neason <69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"659ecc07db10a99cce4aaa688f86b688ed361e58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/659ecc07db10a99cce4aaa688f86b688ed361e58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/b551036042d508e74075f1356e7a8726b64305d6","verification":{"payl