,"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hi-neason","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/072ec40a5fb5fa453c3c4c97925b4a83a26ed5ad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:02:22Z","email":"69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com","name":"hi-neason"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-27T16:02:22Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(ai-service): honor configured monthly point grant amount (#872)\n\ngrant_monthly_points read a non-existent MONTHLY_POINTS setting via getattr with a 100000 fallback, so MONTHLY_GRANT_AMOUNT (the field actually defined on Settings) was silently ignored and every monthly grant used the hard-coded default. Read the real setting instead.\n\nAdd a DB/Redis-free regression test asserting the configured amount is passed to the allocation.\n\nSigned-off-by: neason <69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2b2599638c9c49ceb4062c13928607dfddf0190","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/f2b2599638c9c49ceb4062c13928607dfddf0190"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/072ec40a5fb5fa453c3c4c97925b4a83a26ed5ad","verification":{"payload":"tree f2b2599638c9c49ceb4062c13928607dfddf0190\nparent 15c53ba1dc88eaae07f980778e0282b0b61cfe03\nauthor hi-neason <69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com> 1790524942 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790524942 +0800\n\nfix(ai-service): honor configured monthly point grant amount (#872)\n\ngrant_monthly_points read a non-existent MONTHLY_POINTS setting via getattr with a 100000 fallback, so MONTHLY_GRANT_AMOUNT (the field actually defined on Settings) was silently ignored and every monthly grant used the hard-coded default. Read the real setting instead.\n\nAdd a DB/Redis-free regression test asserting the configured amount is passed to the allocation.\n\nSigned-off-by: neason <69571456+hi-neason@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJquT4OCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHngQAEFlas1Oabg2Di1cYBSexBNg\nFXVYbu3Kx7PFju2ML/RtIZOCyhYuLUfIn3CLTQp2eMdPLT4pzkMbJHFO2UCNOVgB\n+5LNnhT8KyaieboMRYhat1IOvSuZCDfv8m3YHMtOQTKVOhjdTuiKQ883+5QEJi2S\nJ7KIbMq+vjzeQd5+oFeF3d1kdQJD3qXHYKfZ/tCGwpGtZIZIF6zNVxlBN0d/w/Dk\n6pnHjudyUjO5Pxk+2a5SXMGmWKMu9sUu3HenEkQ5SUKDqp4by+GWOTR5fYUgFS08\nSxOxe8QhjaBnVEfY0ex2iLQ4kTm/wlHoJybg0X6NUA+WNLBz2acTg7LwKcH+WIV5\nX098t3qkwtZ71E6IV3bXclbNCPECtooQZoQQPd1iZkgWrikWKbkENJRpzzalsKbz\njXMd1wQb/3y2n+TnmXm8hr0Ev4HIP/+g1HnzdRavPnGou2mjm8+RsAl08zfxQCar\nMq1OXX37DbnBzKmX8mxA5fhtfMA6Yb7OHBFGXJnKGGnNuxITOQURkv1NYwzsoyKt\nwhIfStzS4hoLDd5TiNQ86FWRdj0FC7gIfIBY+pwEqasOLj5CLFC1kNCe+3pSMXtI\nSAHHEBburG81WHXUCH1xC7yfQvsiCH3SlMUuyI0A+cFAcutdphelFeAWNymGEoEI\nQvYV0vVXyaOf4wEzAAl9\n=zmn9\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-27T16:02:22Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https: