ents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/a43d0ca778d3fddfa8e19a5b38443625d1b2db53/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T07:15:48Z","email":"bijinfeng1016@gmail.com","name":"Kebai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T07:15:48Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(frontend): remove login view and clean up routing logic  (#548)\n\n* refactor(frontend): remove login view and clean up routing logic\n\n- Delete obsolete Login view component as authentication is now handled differently\n- Remove unused login-related route guards and hooks\n- Simplify atom tree component logic by flattening business components structure\n- Clean up LogWindow component: remove unused icons, simplify time formatting, and improve JSX rendering\n- Eliminate dead code from useCommonRoute hook\n\n* refactor(electron): improve window manager and streamline IPC handling\n\n- Refactor window manager methods to use async/await with await-to-js for error handling\n- Remove unnecessary Promise wrappers and simplify IPC invocations\n- Consolidate base64 message parsing into single line expressions\n- Move openFileLogModal function directly into useHome hook and remove separate hook file\n- Optimize lazy loading logic in Home view and simplify window resize logic\n- Add await-to-js to bundler''s noExternal configuration for proper packaging\n\n* fix: prevent memory leak by cleaning up event listeners\n\nAdd cleanup for ''open-log-modal'' event listener in useHome hook to prevent potential memory leaks. Also wrap main_window_onload call in error handling to log failures without breaking the flow.","tree":{"sha":"6b765729ea220a71b898306eb725240fcc254603","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/6b765729ea220a71b898306eb725240fcc254603"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/a43d0ca778d3fddfa8e19a5b38443625d1b2db53","verification":{"payload":"tree 6b765729ea220a71b898306eb725240fcc254603\nparent e4eecb4d89ac1c74689f9af2558beed845e9217b\nauthor Kebai <bijinfeng1016@gmail.com> 1770880548 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770880548 +0000\n\nrefactor(frontend): remove login view and clean up routing logic  (#548)\n\n* refactor(frontend): remove login view and clean up routing logic\n\n- Delete obsolete Login view component as authentication is now handled differently\n- Remove unused login-related route guards and hooks\n- Simplify atom tree component logic by flattening business components structure\n- Clean up LogWindow component: remove unused icons, simplify time formatting, and improve JSX rendering\n- Eliminate dead code from useCommonRoute hook\n\n* refactor(electron): improve window manager and streamline IPC handling\n\n- Refactor window manager methods to use async/await with await-to-js for error handling\n- Remove unnecessary Promise wrappers and simplify IPC invocations\n- Consolidate base64 message parsing into single line expressions\n- Move openFileLogModal function directly into useHome hook and remove separate hook file\n- Optimize lazy loading logic in Home view and simplify window resize logic\n- Add await-to-js to bundler''s noExternal configuration for proper packaging\n\n* fix: prevent memory leak by cleaning up event listeners\n\nAdd cleanup for ''open-log-modal'' event listener in useHome hook to prevent potential memory leaks. Also wrap main_window_onload call in error handling to log failures without breaking the flow.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjX4kCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA