b058c4a3da2f89f31fb"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/4920df4ba485e6cc8e94c7ab9b224df80db03b9d","verification":{"payload":"tree a7f3bd2111f8103aec54db058c4a3da2f89f31fb\nparent 61b1c5e41ba5ad4b52372c180445244d52ff6c1a\nauthor Kebai <bijinfeng1016@gmail.com> 1770800310 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770800310 +0000\n\nfix(installer): force kill app process before uninstallation (#540)\n\n* fix(installer): force kill app process before uninstallation\n\nAdd taskkill command to ensure the application process is terminated\nbefore registry cleanup during uninstall. This prevents potential\nregistry key deletion failures when the application is still running.\n\n* fix(electron-installer): clean up stack after killing process\n\nRemove the exit code from the stack after executing taskkill to prevent stack imbalance and potential errors during uninstallation.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjES2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA5qwQAA9qiR/JwdExJBmSBPaV+K/9\nghtPu3c4SPeSOmHjthjTT/85izeBbbt9WU5Ky4lYeLKtDCJbFC0Mymozz5O2JMlk\n+n4v2sxIVLOXWvg0wvePuZY1yKIdHoBbNNwpqa0quHnoq0f3wpbO3JHquy0t7BQw\n6E2ijhULBE6fUliT1RNWMnu5CU4D/hBcNuihbyqx/ufVFUAyVuy7EmVZAkmSf+nr\np5p7GEsfnB4JEmtPcAaArcg+2ZQeN3PIpjBxOSLj2nQBg6zldfW+af6SjvgZY1LQ\nDlySSqmEgsQoEsnppbayKIw+LRcp9whBuJ4HGKymdpsTFU6K18WrH9zgBV2CjPn8\nsDmsWi2Ux8lXrp1JZfP/gTIaJcq3i6vniMTIxsQrzypUFkqxRiHWG8ZstVPoJYk9\nF76xJ0UG8lGu984vmjpn6fYm124JN481JYcVLnJG0YRw+a2squBlUGBCH7hpm51w\n/Su2n8fiDYgmfdszRL4jrQgHqlLzKafY2Uf1EBvoh6X9IxJtwtGjnAUq/D7QdnKX\n3YuCiKgyinEMvUJEB6giYQtHACbvf37eZIB0uD/7DloUPHDO8CwcMuWI/HGgv/Tc\nF0LP3L2tiShjMTx/tDo3PKNGJbWXuCVun11bhSgRh7xKSEywgA1mEOKxhlEKgzgO\n3CALByylbrt0nzqrjr1Z\n=a8za\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-02-11T08:58:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.