ents","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/61b1c5e41ba5ad4b52372c180445244d52ff6c1a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-11T07:37:45Z","email":"bijinfeng1016@gmail.com","name":"Kebai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-11T07:37:45Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: improve delete operations and modal handling  (#538)\n\n* fix: replace file selection dialog implementation\n\nThe previous implementation used a generic form button handler that didn''t properly handle file selection. Now directly use the platform''s utilsManager.showDialog() to open the appropriate file/folder selection dialog based on formType.params.\n\nUpdate flow store with selected values and ensure proper value formatting for both single and multiple selections.\n\n* refactor: improve delete operations and modal handling\n\n- Refactor delete confirmations to use async/await pattern\n- Add refreshWithDelete method to handle pagination after deletions\n- Simplify modal loading state management\n- Replace conditional chaining with optional chaining\n- Fix browser environment plugin list to return empty array\n- Improve pagination logic in NormalTable component\n\n* fix: adjust pagination logic after deletion to prevent invalid page number\n\nWhen deleting items from the last page, the previous logic could set the current page to 0. This update ensures the current page is adjusted to the new total page count, never falling below 1.","tree":{"sha":"e01fc23b99ee49cd2209b14920d8a7f2e858811b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/e01fc23b99ee49cd2209b14920d8a7f2e858811b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/61b1c5e41ba5ad4b52372c180445244d52ff6c1a","verification":{"payload":"tree e01fc23b99ee49cd2209b14920d8a7f2e858811b\nparent b08ff0ee6dc6949acefbdc3c2a1896b1ccfe114a\nauthor Kebai <bijinfeng1016@gmail.com> 1770795465 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1770795465 +0000\n\nrefactor: improve delete operations and modal handling  (#538)\n\n* fix: replace file selection dialog implementation\n\nThe previous implementation used a generic form button handler that didn''t properly handle file selection. Now directly use the platform''s utilsManager.showDialog() to open the appropriate file/folder selection dialog based on formType.params.\n\nUpdate flow store with selected values and ensure proper value formatting for both single and multiple selections.\n\n* refactor: improve delete operations and modal handling\n\n- Refactor delete confirmations to use async/await pattern\n- Add refreshWithDelete method to handle pagination after deletions\n- Simplify modal loading state management\n- Replace conditional chaining with optional chaining\n- Fix browser environment plugin list to return empty array\n- Improve pagination logic in NormalTable component\n\n* fix: adjust pagination logic after deletion to prevent invalid page number\n\nWhen deleting items from the last page, the previous logic could set the current page to 0. This update ensures the current page is adjusted to the new total page count, never falling below 1.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpjDHJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAj0AQADlAVbCltvWKF6+fwy7P4gQS\no+7si0JW9SYSisO+PhZI9ZD6BggCzS3T5iyQVXJ5BFD+sKmlm4SJe2VPMwHLVh9T\n8r2tlMohdivkbwMqitJxGF65eo+To5+zjW8gPsrRSh834t0hNvkoZOtkdIgHHZNR\nNqSDKvTHZeIqkYUBwyRfoQogs9Yx2R9316hmsYmG94W3G8JqAvpwWCyp3LZ7zCRb\nE1IOCrIe2MRPy5wKTJVXjX0jlwCL41IYjFp3uUTvRmj/AhTq31h4zhbWU2jUbL4I\nyquSFf8fLh/y/nHlhLTAZ5BupYG0cKi1CWRozhqeux42TKwgLQwe3McQ/scigFGT\n1Z2kLFogWb+juOKm2+A2ncPoN8k+dqJU2