"html_url":"https://github.com/bijinfeng","id":29982703,"login":"bijinfeng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTgyNzAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/d5044a72545d7a54ffdc419c2e1e44ba7ddbe506/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-03T08:47:56Z","email":"bijinfeng1016@gmail.com","name":"Kebai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-03T08:47:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(components): restructure sheet component exports and usage  (#506)\n\n* refactor(components): restructure sheet component exports and usage\n\n- Add defer attribute to client-sdk script for better loading performance\n- Move sheetUtils from module export to component instance for better encapsulation\n- Fix type imports to use proper type-only imports\n- Update locale handling to use string literals instead of enum constants\n- Remove direct sheetUtils imports in favor of component instance access\n\n* Refactor code structure for improved readability and maintainability\n\n* fix(web-app): move robot-icon script to body with defer attribute\n\nThis ensures the script loads after the DOM is parsed, preventing potential race conditions with client-sdk.js. The ''async'' attribute is replaced with ''defer'' to maintain execution order.","tree":{"sha":"097434b48b6730977eaaebcdb6e9700a7687ae7d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/097434b48b6730977eaaebcdb6e9700a7687ae7d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/d