com/users/bijinfeng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/7ff0fe886ce41a4f2b0080cc7c57ad30a1bd5be4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T08:37:23Z","email":"bijinfeng1016@gmail.com","name":"Kebai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T08:37:23Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(web-app): Fix the issue where the atomic capabilities of the console are unavailable (#484)\n\n* feat(shared-data): enable fetching shared variables and files from API\n\nUncomment and activate the API calls to `getRemoteParams` and `getRemoteFiles` to populate the shared data store with real backend data instead of using placeholder empty arrays.\n\n* refactor(shared-data): optimize shared variable and file fetching\n\n- Remove automatic fetching on component mount to improve performance\n- Convert API functions to async/await and add proper TypeScript types\n- Implement lazy loading for shared variables via dropdown open events\n- Replace manual promise handling with useAsyncState for reactive data\n- Simplify table data fetching by directly using API functions\n- Add overflow styling to dropdown menus for better UI consistency\n\n* refactor(frontend): unify API response handling and improve type safety\n\n- Add ITableResponse type for consistent table data structure\n- Update API functions to directly return data instead of response objects\n- Remove redundant resOption interface and promise wrappers\n- Improve type annotations for table options and API responses\n- Simplify async/await patterns and remove unnecessary promise chains\n- Centralize NormalTable exports in index.ts\n- Clean up unused imports and format directives\n\n* refactor: remove unused import and formatting comment\n\nRemove the ''@format'' comment as it''s likely unnecessary and clean up the unused defineEmits import from Vue.\n\n* refactor(NormalTable): improve header rendering and async handling\n\n- Extract header rendering logic into separate function for better readability\n- Add headerPrefix slot support for custom header content\n- Replace promise chains with async/await and to() for cleaner error handling\n- Simplify Arrange view lifecycle hooks with async/await\n- Remove unused imports and clean up conditional rendering","tree":{"sha":"6763cf5e14ab4ef68c08a53a65c2e04f374f7965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/6763cf5e14ab4ef68c08a53a65c2e04f374f7965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/7ff0fe886ce41a4f2b0080cc7c57ad30a1bd5be4","verification":{"payload":"tree 6763cf5e14ab4ef68c08a53a65c2e04f374f7965\nparent c930ea5451e291c77ba4a1a4b42ec678a7d79400\nauthor Kebai <bijinfeng1016@gmail.com> 1769675843 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769675843 +0800\n\nfix(web-app): Fix the issue where the atomic capabilities of the console are unavailable (#484)\n\n* feat(shared-data): enable fetching shared variables and files from API\n\nUncomment and activate the API calls to `getRemoteParams` and `getRemoteFiles` to populate the shared data store with real backend data instead of using placeholder empty arrays.\n\n* refactor(shared-data): optimize shared variable and file fetching\n\n- Remove automatic fetching on component mount to improve performance\n- Convert API functions to async/await and add proper TypeScript types\n- Implement lazy loading for shared variables via dropdown open events\n- Replace manual promise handling with useAsyncState for reactive data\n- Simplify table data fetching by directly using API functions\n- Add overflow styling to dropdown menus for better UI consistency\n\n* refactor(frontend): unify API response handling and improve type safety\n\n- Add ITableResponse type for consistent table data structure\n- Update API functions to directly return data instead of response objects\n- Remove redundant resOption interface and promise wrappers\n- Improve type annotations for table options and API responses\n- Simplify async/await patterns and remove unnecessary promise chains\n- Centralize NormalTable exports in index.ts\n- Clean up unused imports and format directives\n\n* refactor: remove unused import and formatting comment\n\nRemove the ''@format'' comment as it''s likely unnecessary and clean up the unused defineEmits import from Vue.\n\n* refactor(NormalTable): improve header rendering and async handling\n\n- Extract header rendering logic into separate function for better readability\n- Add headerPrefix slot support for custom header content\n- Replace promise chains with async/await and to() for cleaner error handling\n- Simplify Arrange view lifecycle hooks with async/await\n- Remove unused imports and clean up conditional rendering","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpexxDCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYqYQACkaDKMP21wk5OqMLlgvXsNa\nSHzWBdcGM4Bmw1SSL8D8FiFeLGrZaxP2DvCS6JK02z/tG1c2y1PwkS2kU3b0YW5/\nJBpv8ayxbg3SyCYkqmOF6vwnAvXZLOS51G5J7SzltYxwGVFxzW1p5FBZG6JHhjcU\nTNMrXGGimqQMoKjVl36+r400O3OZ2V4Aw5vlZDWq2ctCuOt+mcPhKKYSZSQkhJFY\ntRiyeBFwqaap/31t7XubU4J00uQVWwZcLrUpEk8qSi1AIFPjDemRUE9QYZ1SkrXA\nj9Zxz47qZO01rk1D+VGRk+FLFzQ2lj4a2vsAZI1ES+/RdN373pxEKSi8tMBAULfj\nS4/WgfU+aos0B+X6VTaO143KKqGdXTBtCbYY1TrCMHcNBhU4mLn0UVXZPsU755bN\np6uVkGfJz4J9HdXkgwyjbGeBp1+Gnzl1w6TiXqiOStGcrcW4aeWyPB+29v/F7ZRr\n452KYjiA7XNhVK8DeSrJ4n7SJQdpW9ewmq4veMP85Smj2Vg7AIgjDBL3nVWcoXaA\nloz4PF8aK+HrMB6RXV2QRX7kD13O/obQKl1l3ffJ/LYI5wIQUFZX8/tzYlJth6oZ\ndxdH25HFl2R68pxXstXmCX5KV+pQXHO1suJamDE+UQh9J02Q8SXweDxwedct9Kpr\nuLUiqLnIfJgyzmCWYPJN\n=Qlbe\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-01-29T08:37:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?