ents","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-29T03:35:55Z","email":"114830331+doctorbruce@users.noreply.github.com","name":"doctorbruce"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-29T03:35:55Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(backend): update new version of backend, combining opensource and SaaS authorization. (#483)\n\n* feat: new version of robot-service and auth (#468)\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest robot repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge config from latest repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: format code for auth and robot by spotless\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek tools dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: add uap dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0126\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update dockerfile of rpa-auth\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: add rpa-auth-stubs-1.0.0.jar\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update Dockerfile\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update Dockerfile, add rpa-auth-stubs.jar installation\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: format code by spotless\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* fix: change the auth-service pom (#471)\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest robot repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge config from latest repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: format code for auth and robot by spotless\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek tools dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: add uap dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0126\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update dockerfile of rpa-auth\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: add rpa-auth-stubs-1.0.0.jar\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update Dockerfile\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update Dockerfile, add rpa-auth-stubs.jar installation\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: format code by spotless\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: remove unused iflytek dependencies from rpa-auth pom.xml\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n* fix(atom-meta):add new atom-meta data initialization (#477)\n\n* fix: update hcl and sql files (#480)\n\n* feat: update schema.sql, add init_c_atom_meta_new_data.sql\n\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat(docker): add new environment variables and enhance MySQL initialization scripts\n\n- Added CUA_BASE_URL and CUA_API_KEY to the .env.example file.\n- Updated docker-compose.yml to include a new SQL initialization script for c_atom_meta.\n- Enhanced MySQL initialization scripts by adding TRUNCATE statements for various tables to ensure clean data loading.\n\nThese changes improve the configuration and data management for the Docker setup.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n* fix(schema): set default value for deleted column in MySQL and HCL files\n\n- Updated the `deleted` column in both MySQL schema.sql and HCL schema.hcl to set a default value of 0, ensuring consistent behavior for logical deletion across different database implementations.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n* refactor: update build and docker configurations\n\n- Modified `build.bat` to include a custom PyPI index for package installation.\n- Removed the `init_c_atom_meta_data.sql` initialization script from `docker-compose.yml` to streamline database setup.\n- Deleted the `c_atom_meta` table definition from `schema.sql` and updated the `c_atom_meta_new` table definition to reflect changes in the database schema.\n- Adjusted the initialization script for `c_atom_meta_new` to ensure proper data loading.\n\nThese changes enhance the build process and improve the clarity of the database schema.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n* feat(sql): update slider_hover initialization for web element interaction\n\n- Enhanced the `slider_hover` entry in the `init_c_atom_meta_new_data.sql` file to improve the functionality for web element interaction, including detailed input parameters for browser object, slider element, progress element, drag direction, and duration.\n\nThese changes aim to provide a more comprehensive setup for handling slider interactions in web automation tasks.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n* feat(docker): enhance build-push workflow and update docker-compose configuration\n\n- Added a new job to the GitHub Actions workflow for building the RPA Auth service, including steps for Docker setup, login, metadata extraction, and image building.\n- Updated the services list in the workflow to include RPA Auth, ensuring it is built alongside other services.\n- Modified the docker-compose.yml to enable the RPA Auth service with a specified image, while commenting out the build context for clarity.\n\nThese changes improve the CI/CD pipeline and streamline the Docker configuration for the RPA Auth service.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>\nCo-authored-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\nCo-authored-by: 方纪强 <1042096700@qq.com>","tree":{"sha":"944766756d399d3f2bb9001b20eaee49d85a6141","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/944766756d399d3f2bb9001b20eaee49d85a6141"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/5ce5ef0cbfd650c75ea9cefdcdb15a35f974a9aa","verification":{"payload":"tree 944766756d399d3f2bb9001b20eaee49d85a6141\nparent cc9a0b9975d121f7d71618a854dbaaab661a6a8e\nauthor doctorbruce <114830331+doctorbruce@users.noreply.github.com> 1769657755 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769657755 +0800\n\nfeat(backend): update new version of backend, combining opensource and SaaS authorization. (#483)\n\n* feat: new version of robot-service and auth (#468)\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest robot repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge config from latest repository 0122\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: format code for auth and robot by spotless\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek tools dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: delete iflytek dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* chore: add uap dependency\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* merge: merge code from latest rap-auth repository 0126\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update dockerfile of rpa-auth\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: add rpa-auth-stubs-1.0.0.jar\n\nSigned-off-by: laiwei3 <laiwei3@iflytek.com>\n\n* feat: update Dockerfile\n\nSigned-off