/commit/239b7fc4b178a5c64f66644f680e61ab185ef421","node_id":"C_kwDOPzfEjNoAKDIzOWI3ZmM0YjE3OGE1YzY0ZjY2NjQ0ZjY4MGU2MWFiMTg1ZWY0MjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iflytek/astron-rpa/commit/298343c0ae3baa995c2d9032164dc673d2211f66","sha":"298343c0ae3baa995c2d9032164dc673d2211f66","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/298343c0ae3baa995c2d9032164dc673d2211f66"}],"sha":"239b7fc4b178a5c64f66644f680e61ab185ef421","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/239b7fc4b178a5c64f66644f680e61ab185ef421"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29982703?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bijinfeng","id":29982703,"login":"bijinfeng","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5OTgyNzAz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bijinfeng","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/commits/298343c0ae3baa995c2d9032164dc673d2211f66/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:33:57Z","email":"bijinfeng1016@gmail.com","name":"Kebai"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-27T08:33:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(web-app): fix LogWindow render PDF file error (#472)\n\n* refactor: move LogWindow component to views directory and ensure window always on top\n\n- Relocate LogWindow component from components to views/Log directory for better project structure\n- Remove obsolete config.ts file as constants are now defined inline\n- Add windowManager call in onMounted to guarantee log window stays on top after creation\n- Update import paths accordingly in Index.vue\n\n* feat(chat): replace pdf-vue3 with vue-pdf-embed and enhance file preview\n\n- Replace pdf-vue3 dependency with vue-pdf-embed for better PDF rendering\n- Add dedicated PDFPreview and Preview components for improved file viewing\n- Implement theme-aware SVG background images for chat interface\n- Centralize app config handling by moving IAppConfig to shared types\n- Update utilsManager to support binary file reading and app config retrieval\n- Remove old chat background image and update styling for consistency\n\n* fix(types): change readFile return type from Buffer to ArrayBuffer\n\nUpdate UtilsManager interface to correctly reflect that readFile returns ArrayBuffer instead of Buffer for consistency with saveFile method. Also fix Vue template prop references in MultiChat preview component to use props prefix.\n\n* refactor(electron): rename readFile parameter for clarity\n\nChange parameter name from ''fileName'' to ''filePath'' to better reflect that the function accepts full paths, not just filenames.\n\n* fix(MultiChat): support binary file previews in chat component\n\nUpdate FileInfo interface to allow previewContent to handle binary data types (Uint8Array, ArrayBuffer) in addition to strings. This ensures proper handling of non-text files in the preview functionality.\n\nModify file reading logic to preserve binary data when file is not a text file, only decoding to string for .txt files. This prevents corruption of binary files during preview generation.","tree":{"sha":"0b0e424090d00280095eb1231f38c1b511900af4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/0b0e424090d00280095eb1231f38c1b511900af4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/298343c0ae3baa995c2d9032164dc673d2211f66","verification":{"payload":"tree 0b0e424090d00280095eb1231f38c1b511900af4\nparent d980f95e24b4d037ef03733ccfb8e3c571ad6ebb\nauthor Kebai <bijinfeng1016@gmail.com> 1769502837 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769502837 +0800\n\nfix(web-app): fix LogWindow render PDF file error (#472)\n\n* refactor: move LogWindow component to views directory and ensure window always on top\n\n- Relocate LogWindow component from components to views/Log directory for better project structure\n- Remove obsolete config.ts file as constants are now defined inline\n- Add windowManager call in onMounted to guarantee log window stays on top after creation\n- Update import paths accordingly in Index.vue\n\n* feat(chat): replace pdf-vue3 with vue-pdf-embed and enhance file preview\n\n- Replace pdf-vue3 dependency with vue-pdf-embed for better PDF rendering\n- Add dedicated PDFPreview and Preview components for improved file viewing\n- Implement theme-aware SVG background images for chat interface\n- Centralize app config handling by moving IAppConfig to shared types\n- Update utilsManager to support binary file reading and app config retrieval\n- Remove old chat background image and update styling for consistency\n\n* fix(types): change readFile return type from Buffer to ArrayBuffer\n\nUpdate UtilsManager interface to correctly reflect that readFile returns ArrayBuffer instead of Buffer for consistency with saveFile method. Also fix Vue template prop references in MultiChat preview component to use props prefix.\n\n* refactor(electron): rename readFile parameter for clarity\n\nChange parameter name from ''fileName'' to ''filePath'' to better reflect that the function accepts full paths, not just filenames.\n\n* fix(MultiChat): support binary file previews in chat component\n\nUpdate FileInfo interface to allow previewContent to handle binary data types (Uint8Array, ArrayBuffer) in addition to strings. This e