Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor(docker): Comment out unused services and ports in docker-compose and nginx configuration (#466)\n\n- Commented out the ports for MySQL and Redis services in docker-compose.yml to disable external access.\n- Removed the rpa-auth service from the docker-compose.yml file to streamline the configuration.\n- Commented out the rpa-auth upstream and related routing in nginx default.conf to prevent routing to the rpa-auth service.\n\nThese changes help simplify the Docker setup and improve clarity in the configuration files.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>","tree":{"sha":"f87768d037ccff3ab5e721c732644f648374146a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/trees/f87768d037ccff3ab5e721c732644f648374146a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iflytek/astron-rpa/git/commits/d980f95e24b4d037ef03733ccfb8e3c571ad6ebb","verification":{"payload":"tree f87768d037ccff3ab5e721c732644f648374146a\nparent 852a4ed95907e45e5a524ef1aa57f4c69ceb6d87\nauthor doctorbruce <114830331+doctorbruce@users.noreply.github.com> 1769480548 +0800\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1769480548 +0800\n\nrefactor(docker): Comment out unused services and ports in docker-compose and nginx configuration (#466)\n\n- Commented out the ports for MySQL and Redis services in docker-compose.yml to disable external access.\n- Removed the rpa-auth service from the docker-compose.yml file to streamline the configuration.\n- Commented out the rpa-auth upstream and related routing in nginx default.conf to prevent routing to the rpa-auth service.\n\nThese changes help simplify the Docker setup and improve clarity in the configuration files.\n\nSigned-off-by: doctorbruce <benyouyou2000@hotmail.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpeCFkCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQQoQAHe8z7R308eg0jf9sPX5CEcL\nbeY6iMzUvbjsYV4RVIybSkX562wDaJoYJLqyEfjendT3RmVqMT9k7MITCgaiugYO\nqluljR2ZR4cbTiT11vleap