,"signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/bbb66bfaa76a932c3cfd92032ac2ea6481e63106","node_id":"C_kwDOPzknVNoAKGJiYjY2YmZhYTc2YTkzMmMzY2ZkOTIwMzJhYzJlYTY0ODFlNjMxMDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77","sha":"4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77"}],"sha":"bbb66bfaa76a932c3cfd92032ac2ea6481e63106","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/bbb66bfaa76a932c3cfd92032ac2ea6481e63106"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:33:53Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:33:53Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"message":"Add internationalization support for multiple languages\n\nIntegrates i18n context and translations for English and Spanish, enabling language switching and localized UI elements across the application.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: a84d7196-adb5-45b3-879f-c78b24c8bc54\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/b353bb24-6b19-407a-b00a-31941eb539a2/a84d7196-adb5-45b3-879f-c78b24c8bc54/w5ewpzO","tree":{"sha":"1084dc1c63ce022c57e72e36b01e488ec7a511b9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/git/trees/1084dc1c63ce022c57e72e36b01e488ec7a511b9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/git/commits/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77","node_id":"C_kwDOPzknVNoAKDRlM2U5MjNiYzBhM2M3N2Y1NzI0M2M1Y2RhN2Q4ZTJjZjg1YTFlNzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343","sha":"32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343"}],"sha":"4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/4e3e923bc0a3c77f57243c5cda7d8e2cf85a1e77"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:29:25Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:29:25Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"message":"Add interactive camera grid and server tree view with drag-and-drop functionality\n\nIntroduces a new `DragDropGrid` component for configurable camera layouts and a `ServerTree` component to display cameras organized by server, with drag-and-drop capabilities for arranging cameras. Updates `StatusIndicator` to include a ''loading'' state and integrates the `ServerTree` into the main app layout.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: a84d7196-adb5-45b3-879f-c78b24c8bc54\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: intermediate_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/b353bb24-6b19-407a-b00a-31941eb539a2/a84d7196-adb5-45b3-879f-c78b24c8bc54/w5ewpzO","tree":{"sha":"f72c0a52bdae6af0180238765b3c8213bde4f2af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/git/trees/f72c0a52bdae6af0180238765b3c8213bde4f2af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/git/commits/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343","node_id":"C_kwDOPzknVNoAKDMyNTkxOTIwYjRiZjBhY2NhNWZhOGQ4ZTU2ZmUwODJjZWJkZmMzNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commit/cd3afbdfdac3c5e694de4f20682d59f75c45c9f3","sha":"cd3afbdfdac3c5e694de4f20682d59f75c45c9f3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/cd3afbdfdac3c5e694de4f20682d59f75c45c9f3"}],"sha":"32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/32591920b4bf0acca5fa8d8e56fe082cebdfc343"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/juand666/ExaVMS2.0/commits/cd3afbdfdac3c5e694de4f20682d59f75c45c9f3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:12:00Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-20T03:12:00Z","email":"47801434-juand666@users.noreply.replit.com","name":"juand666"},"message":"Add new UI components and examples for the surveillance dashboard\n\nThis commit introduces several new UI components and examples, enhancing the visual structure and interactivity of the surveillance dashboard. It includes components for accordions, alert dialogs, alerts, aspect ratios, avatars, badges, breadcrumbs, buttons, calendars, cards, carousels, charts, checkboxes, collapsibles, commands, context menus, dialogs, drawers, dropdown menus, forms, hover cards, input OTPs, inputs, labels, menus, navigation menus, pagination, popovers, progress bars, radio groups, resizable panels, and scroll areas.\n\nReplit-Commit-Author: Agent\nReplit-Commit-Session-Id: a84d7196-adb5-45b3-879f-c78b24c8bc54\nReplit-Commit-Checkpoint-Type: full_checkpoint\nReplit-Commit-Screenshot-Url: https://storage.googleapis.com/screenshot-production-us-central1/b3