om/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/d20f0a33ebb57c3961022a604a3a31a1af1295eb"}],"sha":"0ef2e575d877e8d8ae66e68f6f4edbad47f00ea7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/0ef2e575d877e8d8ae66e68f6f4edbad47f00ea7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2106980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks","id":2106980,"login":"narrowstacks","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDY5ODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/d20f0a33ebb57c3961022a604a3a31a1af1295eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:51:00Z","email":"aaron@affords.art","name":"aaron f.a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T00:51:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: reciprocity comma input, recipes URL sync and search, /development h1, theme hover variants (#389)\n\n* fix(reciprocity): accept comma decimals in metered time schema\n\nThe parser already treats '','' as a decimal separator, but the form schema\nand hydration validator did not, so ''1,5'' showed a result alongside a\nformat error and was dropped on reload.\n\nCloses #373\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(development): keep syncing filters to the URL after an invalid param\n\nAn invalid managed param (e.g. ?iso=1) made initialUrlState return {},\nso the init gate never flipped and the page stopped writing filter\nchanges to the URL for the rest of the session. Drop the invalid param\nand initialise from the valid ones instead.\n\nCloses #371\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(development): apply free-text search to custom recipes\n\nSearch only filtered API recipes, so custom recipes stayed listed for\nany query. Pass the debounced query into useRecipeData and match custom\nrecipes on the same film, developer and dilution text.\n\nCloses #326\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(a11y): give /development an h1 and stop skipping heading levels\n\nThe Development Recipes title was an h2, leaving the page with no h1.\nCalculator ''How this calculator works'' cards also jumped from h2 to h4.\n\nCloses #350\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(theme): make semantic colours Tailwind theme tokens so hover variants work\n\nHandwritten utilities shadowed Tailwind names, so hover: prefixes on them\nemitted no CSS and text-primary resolved to two colours (body text at\nrest, brand green on hover).\n\n- Move the text, border and error colours into an @theme inline block\n  using per-property namespaces, and delete the handwritten copies\n- Rename the brand token --color-primary to --color-brand so no\n  ''primary'' class resolves to it\n- Recipe detail pills use the theme-safe hoverable-action-btn instead of\n  raw hover colours, which would be red on red in Darkroom\n- Drop the dead hover:bg-surface-elevated on the lens swap button\n- Add a test that compiles the stylesheet and fails on any state-prefixed\n  colour class that emits no rule\n\nCloses #297\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6a1516b60257bd344e4f4306f200c1e014b986ec","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/6a1516b60257bd344e4f4306f200c1e014b986ec"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/d20f0a33ebb57c3961022a604a3a31a1af1295eb","verification":{"payload":"tree 6a1516b60257bd344e4f4306f200c1e014b986ec\nparent 10d28ee37d7fc4d7039d39a3c840327873c92e32\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1791420660 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1791420660 -0700\n\nfix: reciprocity comma input, recipes URL sync and search, /development h1, theme hover variants (#389)\n\n* fix(reciprocity): accept comma decimals in metered time schema\n\nThe parser already treats '','' as a decimal separator, but the form schema\nand hydration validator did not, so ''1,5'' showed a result alongside a\nformat error and was dropped on reload.\n\nCloses #373\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(development): keep syncing filters to the URL after an invalid param\n\nAn invalid managed param (e.g. ?iso=1) made initialUrlState return {},\nso the init gate never flipped and the page stopped writing filter\nchanges to the URL for the rest of the session. Drop the invalid param\nand initialise from the valid ones instead.\n\nCloses #371\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(development): apply free-text search to custom recipes\n\nSearch only filtered API recipes, so custom recipes stayed listed for\nany query. Pass the debounced query into useRecipeData and match custom\nrecipes on the same film, developer and dilution text.\n\nCloses #326\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(a11y): give /development an h1 and stop skipping heading levels\n\nThe Development Recipes title was an h2, leaving the page with no h1.\nCalculator ''How this calculator works'' cards also jumped from h2 to h4.\n\nCloses #350\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n* fix(theme): make semantic colours Tailwind theme tokens so hover variants work\n\nHandwritten utilities shadowed Tailwind names, so hover: prefixes on them\nemitted no CSS and text-primary resolved to two colours (body text at\nrest, brand green on hover).\n\n- Move the text, border and error colours into an @theme inline block\n  using per-property namespaces, and delete the handwritten copies\n- Rename the brand token --color-primary to --color-brand so no\n  ''primary'' class resolves to it\n- Recipe detail pills use the theme-safe hoverable-action-btn instead of\n  raw hover colours, which would be red on red in Darkroom\n- Drop the dead hover:bg-surface-elevated on the lens swap button\n- Add a test that compiles the stylesheet and fails on any state-prefixed\n  colour class that emits no rule\n\nCloses #297\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013KPAXSmjTdU7r9usNyHeQu\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqxuj0CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbbIQAGE9hWw457fUpkhSIdVFGXCm\ngCqN3LeRHzWNRGv5s3s14YgPBZ0yI7GSfKrh0RcEW+l8548GeAbLej4dsSt9fFD9\nuA2oPr/os8JPKPN0Onno7JM3+INBmPwVytyfomXP9bpdUyHP7392oucR4QwA4aYf\nbjdnAjNnKEyNg7qjdeemQqJB7kTkX+lZMR2p/VA2DSpP