:"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/609c30e3817f2c40e482e1bf229a32675e173e4e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:45:04Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:45:04Z","email":"41898282+github-actions[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"github-actions[bot]"},"message":"chore: update homepage screenshot [skip ci]","tree":{"sha":"4a5b92340474fb701ad2ada94091dc04bdb5aa76","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/4a5b92340474fb701ad2ada94091dc04bdb5aa76"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/609c30e3817f2c40e482e1bf229a32675e173e4e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/15368?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/github-actions","id":41898282,"login":"github-actions[bot]","node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/github-actions%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commit/609c30e3817f2c40e482e1bf229a32675e173e4e","node_id":"C_kwDOP0YsJdoAKDYwOWMzMGUzODE3ZjJjNDBlNDgyZTFiZjIyOWEzMjY3NWUxNzNlNGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commit/545f2ec0a1a84a95764201660cdbdff4772da5d5","sha":"545f2ec0a1a84a95764201660cdbdff4772da5d5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/545f2ec0a1a84a95764201660cdbdff4772da5d5"}],"sha":"609c30e3817f2c40e482e1bf229a32675e173e4e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/609c30e3817f2c40e482e1bf229a32675e173e4e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2106980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks","id":2106980,"login":"narrowstacks","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDY5ODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/545f2ec0a1a84a95764201660cdbdff4772da5d5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:43:59Z","email":"aaron@affords.art","name":"aaron f.a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:43:59Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(nav): give the open mobile drawer its own close button (#367)\n\n* fix(nav): give the open mobile drawer a reachable close button (#346)\n\nThe mobile drawer had no close control of its own. The FAB that opened it\n(labeled \"Close navigation\" once open) shared the drawer''s z-50 and lost to\nit in paint order, so it was visually hidden under the sidebar footer while\nthe drawer was open. A tap on that spot hit the Settings button instead of\nclosing the drawer, and focus stayed on the now-invisible toggle.\n\n- Add a 44px close button to MobileSidebar''s header, inside the drawer\n  itself, so closing it never depends on a control the drawer might be\n  covering. This is the primary, discoverable fix and the most robust of\n  the two: it holds regardless of any future z-index or layout change.\n- Also bump the FAB to z-[60], one step above the drawer, restoring the\n  exact tap target the bug report describes as broken.\n- Move focus to the new close button when the drawer opens, and back to\n  the FAB when it closes (Escape, backdrop, a nav item, the close button,\n  or the sm-breakpoint auto-close all funnel through the same state\n  change). This is scoped to initial/returned focus only, not a full focus\n  trap — #286 tracks the repo-wide focus-trap primitive that''s still\n  missing across dialogs, and MobileNav/MobileSidebar isn''t even in that\n  issue''s table, so this doesn''t overlap it.\n\nTests added in both packages, verified to fail without the fix (reverted\nmobile-nav.tsx/mobile-sidebar.tsx locally, both suites red, restored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(nav): drop FAB z-index bump; the drawer close button is the fix (#346)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d771ba81d43cd2419caa87d30e8bc6c9aa70f27f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/d771ba81d43cd2419caa87d30e8bc6c9aa70f27f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/545f2ec0a1a84a95764201660cdbdff4772da5d5","verification":{"payload":"tree d771ba81d43cd2419caa87d30e8bc6c9aa70f27f\nparent 288f846552faee50029114ba2150254f1c5d50bd\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1790196239 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790196239 -0700\n\nfix(nav): give the open mobile drawer its own close button (#367)\n\n* fix(nav): give the open mobile drawer a reachable close button (#346)\n\nThe mobile drawer had no close control of its own. The FAB that opened it\n(labeled \"Close navigation\" once open) shared the drawer''s z-50 and lost to\nit in paint order, so it was visually hidden under the sidebar footer while\nthe drawer was open. A tap on that spot hit the Settings button instead of\nclosing the drawer, and focus stayed on the now-invisible toggle.\n\n- Add a 44px close button to MobileSidebar''s header, inside the drawer\n  itself, so closing it never depends on a control the drawer might be\n  covering. This is the primary, discoverable fix and the most robust of\n  the two: it holds regardless of any future z-index or layout change.\n- Also bump the FAB to z-[60], one step above the drawer, restoring the\n  exact tap target the bug report describes as broken.\n- Move focus to the new close button when the drawer opens, and back to\n  the FAB when it closes (Escape, backdrop, a nav item, the close button,\n  or the sm-breakpoint auto-close all funnel through the same state\n  change). This is scoped to initial/returned focus only, not a full focus\n  trap — #286 tracks the repo-wide focus-trap primitive that''s still\n  missing across dialogs, and MobileNav/MobileSidebar isn''t even in that\n  issue''s table, so this doesn''t overlap it.\n\nTests added in both packages, verified to fail without the fix (reverted\nmobile-nav.tsx/mobile-sidebar.tsx locally, both suites red, restored).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(nav): drop FAB z-index bump; the drawer close button is the fix (#346)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtDoPCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAALFcQAHasYum3sVqDKpL1MIrukedp\npae6UMbRA6ltOwN7gJXM1wmJeqLRwg5wT3GQ2NuoIGpe3X4NyBdTyN1RCYDgnCRD\nQNT1fAJU+sanYLpr8njwJDfDVY3c8SUYZlPZqJ+XAEo+/L4iVfU4ACZOPyGddoAI\nyw29BEDC2lcRmmouqdLG2TRTpnJE4NAj3Fs8F7UDhZrMuBm4w6i07Tl9mo+3Qpvl\nRM0KG8OLo8NQW2JszQYDJ1PCTuDb9bTtUxZv759fVt+R2j57Hp63MfYTPvxKHyhS\nDjBBFzz2yBu2MTBGvq/p0xkMkcKijSxx9xm/XMa2GbqP4Bo9ETYV2MccZct2N5nL\n2faWGQj5XUe9no4cT/mhs+JilGdMA6Nj01d39dODROTgwVTnoSY05BCG3LbdGFSB\nSf03XHtsNPgc0yt1h+nGtxzWyg8wISIYeluyL0365m4oCDtYTOTPFrUo27e3SuFq\nib6wfN+vZ0Bexb2Q9qvVxVGSpY7rptLmMc4Wa/9FfApVbixy2xXR+ETqTNqTjaqu\nC1FvLhEj1rfcd+KCBuwMcuyMXpNYPBvXk5d6hUEt4YRfMeEMrQMtJXFVzS5b/N+O\ndf5aWW+PmggBg69k3j3fjcsNn6pOqQhGGGP2NMf031tca5nBCa005wNEr5PIPC+k\n7kIeZ61CDuN5dVl9q0hL\n=Wyoz\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T20:43:59Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.git