NTllNGJhNjM0MjE3OGE2ODI4Y2JjZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commit/a1dbbcceb0797a16b4d50b67c79388621677ef58","sha":"a1dbbcceb0797a16b4d50b67c79388621677ef58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/a1dbbcceb0797a16b4d50b67c79388621677ef58"}],"sha":"2485cfb46fb12281e59e4ba6342178a6828cbcd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/2485cfb46fb12281e59e4ba6342178a6828cbcd1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2106980?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks","id":2106980,"login":"narrowstacks","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDY5ODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/a1dbbcceb0797a16b4d50b67c79388621677ef58/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:43:30Z","email":"aaron@affords.art","name":"aaron f.a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T20:43:30Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(recipes): clear favorites-only with other filters (#364)\n\n* fix(recipes): clear favorites-only with other filters (#327)\n\nfavoritesOnly is page-level state in DevelopmentRecipesPage, not part of\nuseDevelopmentRecipes, so the hook''s clearFilters could never reset it even\nthough both filter UIs count it as an active filter and show the Clear\nbutton. Add useClearFilters, a small wrapper hook that resets favoritesOnly\nalongside the hook-owned filters, and wire it in for both FiltersSidebar and\nCollapsibleFilters. The favorites URL param and search-dead-end analytics\nfilter count already react to favoritesOnly, so no separate reset is needed\nthere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(recipes): tidy clear-filters comments (#327)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f2be0c65e47165ad5ab965da01f4f6f92cb7c557","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/f2be0c65e47165ad5ab965da01f4f6f92cb7c557"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/a1dbbcceb0797a16b4d50b67c79388621677ef58","verification":{"payload":"tree f2be0c65e47165ad5ab965da01f4f6f92cb7c557\nparent bedd17a2b1952032c17f75a3d0a87eec1a4ec774\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1790196210 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790196210 -0700\n\nfix(recipes): clear favorites-only with other filters (#364)\n\n* fix(recipes): clear favorites-only with other filters (#327)\n\nfavoritesOnly is page-level state in DevelopmentRecipesPage, not part of\nuseDevelopmentRecipes, so the hook''s clearFilters could never reset it even\nthough both filter UIs count it as an active filter and show the Clear\nbutton. Add useClearFilters, a small wrapper hook that resets favoritesOnly\nalongside the hook-owned filters, and wire it in for both FiltersSidebar and\nCollapsibleFilters. The favorites URL param and search-dead-end analytics\nfilter count already react to favoritesOnly, so no separate reset is needed\nthere.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(recipes): tidy clear-filters comments (#327)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtDnyCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA3XIQAEIuxrfzY1K4FoMza3z0TpEu\nMGaxSqSLm53Y+vbnBPE0N8GBolRZ0eXNiVs2DcVdjTZb/xrWnvYvGOsOJP5LRcfp\nQg5dmY9yRLVsWVhGz2YKrEU0IYHR3HPhz9XfWWZ6/mJYdnleVU8xYYPf6VhIxMAv\n3Jo/vlSX6kClIBv3xLfHo43wNVpNz557nCBioFv3Lpp+eDaHwPKSRE1cxlgkCFCX\n83EgGUdzMM7FxmeAhIJfTJ/5SveQCx6AS4ID21ePX/uL+/5D4U02f59o937yd1/Y\ncMDaqCOKHVvjM+JpMLvmbteFZbi7cSYMAGth0k9CdSzv9duAAQHTwD8viS22Kiz6\n/fmgVn1sxROFZBTPxD5wZaWdttqEcLpeQcACw2lohZKd4/b+EpgeMU2LKNgsjiO1\n0fpNz0dFsYAHkQtVguWD5LOhoALKvZ3o+ZvqJ9qH7GGyquZ6l3h5QzTwgcPFS10R\niNs0xLp+m4woSuYAG+eWIEY0q9+SQKdpe8ZCI1UPPJR8vQuXyc1/CX77uj9LM5vY\nC9I3saPc8DqBrebHTl2lJbWR18fuUkx82ewOkcxdDtDTkp8IAn9zZp9WuY8tbPSC\nOfvninbSrMAwPtVf03M+Ch1tCAMIidbmAPZtMlyT+Wkw9gaXI8X6E4+RZPn/VaLE\nYG+wkHCnAZoy0JzDN1ew\n=pAEp\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T20:43:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"