ollowing{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks","id":2106980,"login":"narrowstacks","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDY5ODA=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/narrowstacks","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/commits/2199f9b1c4048f8b8b5aeb74b22ad59297fb6863/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-21T23:42:18Z","email":"aaron@affords.art","name":"aaron f.a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T23:42:18Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(border): validate preset share links before they reach form state (#314)\n\ndecodePreset shape-checked the payload but never parsed it, so a\nhand-edited ?preset= link put a negative minBorder or a ±9999 offset\nstraight into form state through 21 sequential setFieldValue calls. The\nform only validates onBlur, so nothing caught those values until the\nuser happened to touch that exact field.\n\nDecoded settings now go through sharedBorderPresetSettingsSchema: a\nnumeric field outside the slider range is clamped to the nearest valid\nvalue (a link is the only copy of the preset it carries), while a\nwrong-typed field, a non-finite number or an unknown enum member still\nrejects the link. Absent fields take BORDER_CALCULATOR_DEFAULTS through\nthat schema instead of the fallbacks decode declared itself, one of\nwhich disagreed with the constants. applyPresetSettings replaces the\nvalues in one form.reset(..., { keepDefaultValues: true }) — without\nthat option reset adopts the preset as the form''s defaults and the next\nuseForm render reverts it.\n\nFixes #287","tree":{"sha":"0948e2cb6771db0f849fc8834f24e828c1947766","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/0948e2cb6771db0f849fc8834f24e828c1947766"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/2199f9b1c4048f8b8b5aeb74b22ad59297fb6863","verification":{"payload":"tree 0948e2cb6771db0f849fc8834f24e828c1947766\nparent 962030788fef9ad63ecbf553f74b6c4296b26895\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1790034138 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790034138 -0700\n\nfix(border): validate preset share links before they reach form state (#314)\n\ndecodePreset shape-checked the payload but never parsed it, so a\nhand-edited ?preset= link put a negative minBorder or a ±9999 offset\nstraight into form state through 21 sequential setFieldValue calls. The\nform only validates onBlur, so nothing caught those values until the\nuser happened to touch that exact field.\n\nDecoded settings now go through sharedBorderPresetSettingsSchema: a\nnumeric field outside the slider range is clamped to the nearest valid\nvalue (a link is the only copy of the preset it carries), while a\nwrong-typed field, a non-finite number or an unknown enum member still\nrejects the link. Absent fields take BORDER_CALCULATOR_DEFAULTS through\nthat schema instead of the fallbacks decode declared itself, one of\nwhich disagreed with the constants. applyPresetSettings replaces the\nvalues in one form.reset(..., { keepDefaultValues: true }) — without\nthat option reset adopts the preset as the form''s defaults and the next\nuseForm render reverts it.\n\nFixes #287","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqscDaCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAC2sQADOguhlFmid6oFU7Vm0eojTE\n3fMd70LvHfJDDy6sjRmxgYVZ09TY4ldYIUIwBdkpz5ucMH3RLIc+vN0ttdCAGvgs\n98o0ogEIlOWLPAUaQJKL9krlRDEpwgrEGHeyrzg0oksNEfLJqSGXNaEylOBm731Y\n0xFislFdDnf