ge icon so /settings shares stop falling back to the home icon,\nand removes the dead isValidNumericParam helper.\n\n* chore(api): point fuzzy enum comment at the real openapi source\n\n* docs(api): describe X-Client-Id limits as extra ceilings, not per-install isolation\n\n* test(api): assert the /settings OG icon selection directly","tree":{"sha":"3858ff9f89f3a3a1fb3fca33feab19632a75bb58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/3858ff9f89f3a3a1fb3fca33feab19632a75bb58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/962030788fef9ad63ecbf553f74b6c4296b26895","verification":{"payload":"tree 3858ff9f89f3a3a1fb3fca33feab19632a75bb58\nparent 5f1999c9add166106a963198e5d7e7e63a107586\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1790034135 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790034135 -0700\n\nfix(api): validate fuzzy enum, document aliases and X-Client-Id, add /settings OG icon (#313)\n\n* fix(api): validate fuzzy enum, document aliases/X-Client-Id, add /settings OG icon\n\nCloses #255. Validates `fuzzy` against its documented true/false enum\n(dropping invalid values, consistent with how limit/count/page are\nhandled), documents the Film `aliases`/`base_film_slug` fields and the\n`X-Client-Id` rate-limiting header in docs/API.md, adds a Settings gear\nOG image icon so /settings shares stop falling back to the home icon,\nand removes the dead isValidNumericParam helper.\n\n* chore(api): point fuzzy enum comment at the real openapi source\n\n* docs(api): describe X-Client-Id limits as extra ceilings, not per-install isolation\n\n* test(api): assert the /settings OG icon selection directly","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqscDXCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAwwIQAD3uYKhZzCggQ4kfYE2I/LPk\nM7SU+Tr23SmwHa/ETjshulNTG9FF0n+mJl2+cx8GW1BoSN4c6CHbFO/V6fbWyqEc\n+stxfVh4PzABwro5b1XVofkxah5bxWh+3W+PlsYzhoMio0zRna1OO0oJGDBMdHlD\nxIx1MYpxt+4owNI5uvSMADwWojhb8kfhor5OiIDn6DHxwTDqzwOFJmSoDfQA3eY9\nRv2f3ZWu