i): OG recipe card never substitutes an unrelated recipe on a uuid miss (#308)\n\n* fix(api): stop og recipe card from substituting an unrelated combination\n\nlookupCombination now pages through /api/combinations (capped at 10\npages) to find a shared recipe''s uuid, and returns null on a miss\ninstead of falling back to data[0], so a >50-recipe pairing never\nrenders the wrong time/temp/ISO on the OG card (#252).\n\n* fix(api): page combinations with count, which upstream requires for page to apply","tree":{"sha":"36d2af44a8f867ef488733c487c51cc11423122e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/36d2af44a8f867ef488733c487c51cc11423122e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/aa6477b5a9b271d51f98979fd31596b0cfd7c53a","verification":{"payload":"tree 36d2af44a8f867ef488733c487c51cc11423122e\nparent bdf0f3ad009f8bb68465f1f6f0d2ad1a40bb8f0f\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1789682434 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789682434 -0700\n\nfix(api): OG recipe card never substitutes an unrelated recipe on a uuid miss (#308)\n\n* fix(api): stop og recipe card from substituting an unrelated combination\n\nlookupCombination now pages through /api/combinations (capped at 10\npages) to find a shared recipe''s uuid, and returns null on a miss\ninstead of falling back to data[0], so a >50-recipe pairing never\nrenders the wrong time/temp/ISO on the OG card (#252).\n\n* fix(api): page combinations with count, which upstream requires for page to apply","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrGMCCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAL/wQABJmqz+RBVPhKXHuln3wIZ/H\ncDKjTfWtYyFiNiPQ8aJgpwEakMIJODScWlsrEP7eiPS09tSDNedNSJNM8BBQ8Ll2\nHdTeP7U3219Huvf9S8s2OffVKrR5cmBbiEfzL8lahZy57IBAw6ZExw9FYImiPyv+\n/G8l/TlG6hDpw0rmXi+8Ix9jZX+hlGatlBOVZ/EZWEZSblaWhsUgi6BdCkCg3KrD\nyx8g+OWypd0rHnPf79DJEUzAVTVbKhBdT5ZD8AmM+2tGQPxMSnJLyIZtcdVIaesy\n5OxTrZ8dosoFJeKmhdw+8HPanhQApSUO5Ays2yythkn1hjORo2MXnBPQ5obu7zTL\nKZTRY