85a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T22:00:25Z","email":"aaron@affords.art","name":"aaron f.a"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T22:00:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(api): define mock _headers as own property so serverless tests pass on Node 22 (#306)\n\nObject.assign copied _headers through OutgoingMessage.prototype''s deprecated\nsetter (DEP0066) on Node <24 instead of creating an own property, leaving\nevery res._headers assertion reading undefined. Define _headers via\nObject.defineProperty on the target before merging so it becomes a real own\nproperty on every Node version. Also corrects the README''s stated minimum\nNode version to match engines.node.","tree":{"sha":"7d3ca137738c384bef32a08397469487258a5140","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/7d3ca137738c384bef32a08397469487258a5140"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/7cbc177de23d75190ef4a95b9898fb213558985a","verification":{"payload":"tree 7d3ca137738c384bef32a08397469487258a5140\nparent a46692771c65ce25aab89699422139151b7b6e51\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1789682425 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789682425 -0700\n\nfix(api): define mock _headers as own property so serverless tests pass on Node 22 (#306)\n\nObject.assign copied _headers through OutgoingMessage.prototype''s deprecated\nsetter (DEP0066) on Node <24 instead of creating an own property, leaving\nevery res._headers assertion reading undefined. Define _headers via\nObject.defineProperty on the target before merging so it becomes a real own\nproperty on every Node version. Also corrects the README''s stated minimum\nNode version to match engines.node.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrGL5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAW0MQAHaIT6bH06XvyktZE0QvNfU9\n90EFcRpI2zH/9Iz2hmcxxpEGswgO/Z/VIFGySNw/OEuP7I0dftD8acE5WuhwRBL8\n94axEUey54wEJiQd0puzBgIzccheICRdUXouQ00CUXMJmCw