ts 1044-line test suite: deprecated\n  in favour of the modular hooks, zero call sites.\n- The development-recipes context/ directory (287): the page wires\n  useRecipeModals directly instead.\n\nbun run test is green and identical to the pre-change baseline.","tree":{"sha":"4325d65959dc0195ed41b815307a152e4a5d74f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/4325d65959dc0195ed41b815307a152e4a5d74f1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/f716df96b684ec19def0563d127697b06b278573","verification":{"payload":"tree 4325d65959dc0195ed41b815307a152e4a5d74f1\nparent e6791e3110ea72b1bde1e4533ab20ba831ef3238\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1789677905 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789677905 -0700\n\nrefactor: delete three dead calculator forks (#293)\n\nNone of these are imported anywhere in the monorepo, and @dorkroom/ui\nand @dorkroom/logic are workspace-only with no external consumers.\n\n- MobileBorderCalculator (1039): a stale fork of the live\n  use-border-calculator-controller. It had already diverged, still doing\n  whole-snapshot safeParse where the controller validates per key since\n  dd55a5cd, yet it was edited in both dd55a5cd and 5beadc71.\n- useLegacyBorderCalculator (346) and its 1044-line test suite: deprecated\n  in favour of the modular hooks, zero call sites.\n- The development-recipes context/ directory (287): the page wires\n  useRecipeModals directly instead.\n\nbun run test is green and identical to the pre-change baseline.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrFFRCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA1PAQACMkQxEn/SEy7StrUuFtFZ/K\nO/puiUVJbjHPDjIXjY0HsUUaLM72QzYPpYWEBry20z+R7xqGctzuHVGkMtKmfDta\nEM3xPG/1VnucPz7um4dB5mFNByqp/20S/6H+LlzP2dhasx+qguDVazAufLOp7hBM\nWxviss2xrI0W4waiawCBmdk3B/ur37sdAfCZyqylnn3XYeH0T9X0bK/Qe8Cvyg/1\nutqlttWPy3D9vznDDhG3HonV6iFOcDC7m9hE9rp/4fVhhXyCsC31Ow2RHxyB3kje\nuVlCcT3FDGWM33DbZ4O3pCNAhsSDVXKfLewl1mwGHlLLRoaVygEjtlsFFCYeSR11\n