putes outOfRange for the solved\naperture, mirroring the aperture-priority branch.\n\nFixes #241","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqmO6XCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAE7gQAKN+zkl+pDTvcZTJHmIyi6qZ\nCfRwPWP0QuHygfTOzNhBKiIiVjPl1viw+e/BIcW9HZWi2vS8laLt/PL2nI01mDXn\npnEgavTQDbr8oV5jqnI7EhVbUk1ppOHres7xmEg9em9nMBgo1oAZok7S43wC6rvd\no6HhU7Oqr59+E7rq+RmRvcZWh/q8B1X/9wWCHGm9jBDyHE1/TcVxmDOl23m5PDsn\nG+R8pD0T5YOxVQozDpgoX66VvFR0Hano/spJCaNi0hoKxNe4MIVN0gAbtFLyrjlk\nprUv1kzikZWpeelrV+Tju+abYp57pl6GSAG0socyeLuDhl5YH5pTk7faYim7YyTR\nxSuR8CIZtROAuhbFLXQ56yiBSIPjY8fYSJt3r7teaN5w2ad2TuNf5c2WOyM9U4vo\nF1vrqKOwWOGeFaz7dzXEogHStnuAIQBncPpUzwba1bXGGcIh8hZ9fdow+nwr9aWl\n9GpsnOtuMAJDBQnAJJdv7hJYU5Xq2Q58B39EZLogV+aPBfeVgQ3Bxqq+YJ/Vgk/G\nV/sV5E0v0nrLy9aoMvrWpt86KluNgXRLAz22406nh9y3ExYBOIySV9nA27I5OEYu\nTogu8/f7M8WNnjHn4qs0N2Z2B+1zZl3hpuPhamGhD7e+P4Qilfa7AMiQ6lX/QArZ\nrGvSR/rwh7um0Pv8iHFY\n=t8t3\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-03T03:50:47Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/narrowstacks/dorkroom