\n\nreact-doctor renamed `no-multi-comp` to `no-multi-component-file`. The\nten existing disable comments still named the old rule, so they stopped\nsuppressing anything and four of them resurfaced as warnings, holding\nthe score at 90/100.\n\nRenaming the references restores 100/100. The suppressions and their\njustifications are unchanged; only the rule name moves.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FGkAEkc1LEKkiYnLc2hn1d\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e4299df76f90fb5fa176b52c1d608f273f80eb99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/trees/e4299df76f90fb5fa176b52c1d608f273f80eb99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/narrowstacks/dorkroom/git/commits/6e2f31e8add9665330a21fe1b528cdbfe38a9906","verification":{"payload":"tree e4299df76f90fb5fa176b52c1d608f273f80eb99\nparent 40f4e4da48608c01db2e5d44d4cb390c59e78b52\nauthor aaron f.a <aaron@affords.art> 1787294293 -0700\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787294293 -0700\n\nfix(lint): restore react-doctor suppressions after rule rename (#229)\n\nreact-doctor renamed `no-multi-comp` to `no-multi-component-file`. The\nten existing disable comments still named the old rule, so they stopped\nsuppressing anything and four of them resurfaced as warnings, holding\nthe score at 90/100.\n\nRenaming the references restores 100/100. The suppressions and their\njustifications are unchanged; only the rule name moves.\n\n\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FGkAEkc1LEKkiYnLc2hn1d\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqh/JVCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA9roQACVm+bOU5cKMEJs4B/gaMlqk\nbKJZ3UDaC8k3tH3YY0+1br3VCsmeknZf0jX8zaCiCfa12Ex+eDgrwo/1xGJ19IHl\nikp5YHZyq2xr4UU41lRTpQLDAw49n5O3nxh6SoLn82IhfX4fAKmR8gmuDsMci6qt\n3un3vPUxWOrdAQy75Q1EWzv3i5kQXG15/6sq/Ex7GJkKxMAtszpzSEk/A6aSlth0\nIpRUP5XrlOQ8ysNufSX/fGR48330lpIk4fYTfCAs2ZtGN6fJfr9P