c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanrish/video-chunker/commits/5084058923a980c102e82ad199869053bc32cd8c"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanrish/video-chunker/commits/df9a13b3c39dcdadc990f6560fc9346537e9d2ea/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-09-26T03:04:09Z","email":"rishinathr@users.noreply.github.com","name":"RishinathR"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-09-26T03:04:09Z","email":"rishinathr@users.noreply.github.com","name":"RishinathR"},"message":"feat: Add complete CI/CD pipeline, React.js frontend, and intelligent file management\n\n- Add React.js micro frontend architecture with Material-UI\n- Implement automatic file cleanup and ZIP archiving\n- Add 24-hour auto-purge for output files\n- Create comprehensive CI/CD pipeline with GitHub Actions\n- Add complete test suite with unit, integration, and E2E tests\n- Implement file management dashboard with real-time monitoring\n- Add production-ready Docker and deployment configurations\n- Create comprehensive documentation suite\n- Add QA automation and security scanning\n- Implement background cleanup thread for storage management\n\nNew Features:\n- Automatic input file deletion after processing\n- ZIP archive creation for all meeting files\n- Real-time storage monitoring and cleanup status\n- Modern React.js frontend with micro frontend architecture\n- Complete API documentation and testing guides\n- Production deployment scripts for Windows and Linux\n\nTechnical Improvements:\n- Enhanced file management service with safety features\n- Updated orchestrator with new workflow steps\n- Added comprehensive error handling and logging\n- Implemented background cleanup thread\n- Created production-ready Docker configurations\n- Added security scanning and code quality checks","tree":{"sha":"4a016ffa8581312ddb5d52a5835a3d64de7739e5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nathanrish/video-chunker/git/trees/4a016ffa8581312ddb5d52a5835a3d64de7739e5"},"url":"https://