Lorenzo De Francesco"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:26:16.061Z","repositoryId":1061944269,"sha":"c870a0dc0398f8de64dfe8447dd8ca67bae3879b"},{"author":{"account":{"login":"Lory1990","providerType":"User"},"email":"Lory1990@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"authoredDate":"2025-09-22T15:39:56Z","committedDate":"2025-09-22T15:39:56Z","committer":{"account":{"login":"web-flow","providerType":"User"},"email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:26:16.061Z","repositoryId":1061944269,"sha":"a70c350727a5eb827027992f7680efc4f28ae476"}],"observedAt":"2026-10-08T20:26:16.061Z","raw":[{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/5cea8604133b42d27845e46e434c3e1aea5d21b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:17:44Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:17:44Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore: update the dependencies\n\nEverything moves to its latest release, with two deliberate exceptions:\n\n- TypeScript stays on 5.9.3. 7.0.2 is out, but it removes options the\n  templates still declare, vue-tsc crashes loading it, and @ngtools/webpack\n  fails to initialise the Angular compiler with it.\n- Angular stays on the 21 line: @angular/compiler-cli 22 peer-requires\n  typescript >=6.0 <6.1, and 6.0 has only ever been published as a beta.\n\nAlso drops @types/webpack-dev-server, a deprecated stub package —\nwebpack-dev-server ships its own types.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5408660b21059b1bcbd7dd9008c90f1b5107ca5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/trees/e5408660b21059b1bcbd7dd9008c90f1b5107ca5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/commits/5cea8604133b42d27845e46e434c3e1aea5d21b0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/5cea8604133b42d27845e46e434c3e1aea5d21b0","node_id":"C_kwDOP0v7zdoAKDVjZWE4NjA0MTMzYjQyZDI3ODQ1ZTQ2ZTQzNGMzZTFhZWE1ZDIxYjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1","sha":"0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1"}],"sha":"5cea8604133b42d27845e46e434c3e1aea5d21b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/5cea8604133b42d27845e46e434c3e1aea5d21b0"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:09:48Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T09:09:48Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"refactor: port the template to TypeScript\n\nSources, entry point and bundler config are TypeScript now, type-checked as\npart of `pnpm build`, so a scaffolded project starts out typed instead of\nhaving to be converted by hand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ade997b8d6b98a459f715432d3cc9bd1e525e9ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/trees/ade997b8d6b98a459f715432d3cc9bd1e525e9ab"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/commits/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1","node_id":"C_kwDOP0v7zdoAKDBiMmY4NTE0NmIzMDZhMDU5MDBkOTllNGZiMTFhZWMzNTU0YTZmZDE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71","sha":"2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71"}],"sha":"0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/0b2f85146b306a05900d99e4fb11aec3554a6fd1"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:52:18Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T08:52:18Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore: declare the frameworks as peer dependencies\n\nA remote is loaded into a host that already provides the framework, so\nshipping our own copy invites a second copy at runtime. The frameworks stay\nin devDependencies as well, so the template still builds and runs on its own.\nAligns with template-webpack-react-remote, which already did this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1508178357ff33f26617cf5dcf89f57ce1f87ab3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/trees/1508178357ff33f26617cf5dcf89f57ce1f87ab3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/commits/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71","node_id":"C_kwDOP0v7zdoAKDJlYWM2ODdhMzkwZjY3NGExMmQwNTNjMmMzZDM3ZDdkNDExNTJjNzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commit/e82462b1d4fbe0c959cbbc78d5762604ed9a21b0","sha":"e82462b1d4fbe0c959cbbc78d5762604ed9a21b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/e82462b1d4fbe0c959cbbc78d5762604ed9a21b0"}],"sha":"2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/2eac687a390f674a12d053c2c3d37d7d41152c71"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/commits/e82462b1d4fbe0c959cbbc78d5762604ed9a21b0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:12:01Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-11T15:12:01Z","email":"lorenzo.defrancesco@azimutmarketplace.it","name":"Lorenzo De Francesco"},"message":"chore(deps): pin pnpm 11.21.0, bump vite to 8.2.1, refresh lockfile\n\n- pin packageManager to pnpm@11.21.0 as the single source of truth\n- bump vite to ^8.2.1 (@vitejs/plugin-react ^5.0.4 already resolves to\n  5.2.0, which supports vite 8, so no plugin change is needed)\n- regenerate pnpm-lock.yaml for the new resolutions\n\nVerified: install and build exit 0 from a pristine clone, the container\nis still emitted at assets/remoteEntry.js, still exports get/init, and\nthe exposed ./Button renders identically to the vite 7 output with react\nsupplied through the share scope.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"55935dbfccc972ae51b9e0f6f300c332f188ee3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template-vite-remote/git/trees/55935dbfccc972ae51b9e0f6f300c332f188ee3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/mfe-orchestrator/template